<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant is recommended.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant is recommended.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it added Guidant Corp to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- had Guidant as market perform.</p>
<p>-- additional details not available.</p>
<p>-- Guidant was up four points to 86-3/4.</p>
</text>
